.TH VLFSTATUS 1 "November 2026" "vlfstatus 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
vlfstatus \- Lightweight, high-frequency status bar generator for i3bar and swaybar
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vlfstatus
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B vlfstatus
is a feature-packed status bar generator written in pure Bash and optimized for minimal subprocess fork/exec overhead.
It feeds formatted JSON status blocks to \fBi3bar\fR and \fBswaybar\fR, displaying live telemetry including CPU load, memory usage, network SSID, audio volume, battery percentages, and optional AI quota consumption via \fBfetch_quota.py\fR.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-help
Displays usage instructions.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR i3bar (1),
.BR swaybar (1)
.SH AUTHORS
Maintained by Vikyek <https://github.com/Vikyek/vlfstatus>.
